' Raumkarte und Systemflug
Campaign "1" *-- "0..1" SystemFlight : flight
SystemFlight "*" --> "1" Hex : world
SystemFlight "1" *-- "1..*" SpaceUnit : units {ordered}
SpaceUnit "*" --> "1" Ship : ship
SpaceUnit "1" *-- "*" TrackPoint : track {ordered}
Hex "1" *-- "0..1" StarSystem : system
StarSystem "1" *-- "1..3" Star : stars {ordered}
StarSystem "1" *-- "*" Satellite : satellites {ordered}
StarSystem "1" *-- "*" GasGiant : giants {ordered}
StarSystem "*" --> "0..1" GasGiant : host
Star "*" --> "1" StarZones : /zones
Star --> StarType
Star --> StarSize
SystemFlight "*" --> "0..1" GasGiant : at
GasGiant "1" *-- "*" Satellite : satellites {ordered}
Satellite --> SatelliteKind

